  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Wastewalker Zeke, formerly a data miner before the great Liquidity Crash, now scrapes the underlevels of Subchain City for lost caches of DRIP. The streets took their toll, but he patched himself up enough to deal with local gangs.",
    "class": "Scavenger",
    "name": "Wastewalker Zeke",
    "personality": "Brooding and resourceful. Zeke is a loner who prefers the company of rust and ruin to the squawks of other ducks, but he's fiercely loyal to those who earn his trust. He has seen it all, and isn't easily surprised or impressed.",
